{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfY25Hnmn7FUuGpkJiye1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"{\"statements\":[{\"statement_id\":\"S1\",\"role\":\"finding\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O441\"],\"text\":\"Leave requests for the last week of December are rejected automatically.\"},{\"statement_id\":\"S2\",\"role\":\"design_constraint\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O442\"],\"text\":\"The personnel system blocks leave during the year-end stock count.\"},{\"statement_id\":\"S3\",\"role\":\"next_step\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O443\"],\"text\":\"Explain the block to staff who ask.\"}],\"conclusion\":\"behavior_by_design\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":610,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":240,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":62},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null}